## Solution and recommendations

To address this issue, we recommend upgrading to the latest fixed version o=
f VoIPmonitor GUI.

We recommended the following to the vendor:

> Values that are user controlled should be correctly encoded before being =
rendered in the browser. Additionally, JSON output should have the `Content=
-Type` header of JSON rather than `text/html`.

> These vulnerabilities seem to exist throughout the whole web application =
so we suggest that a thorough exercise should be carried out to identify an=
y other potential Cross-Site scripting issues in sections which have not be=
en identified in our report.

